AdoptedSdGuard (MasterROM): refuses format/repartition of an SD card used as internal storage
(adopted) unless the caller is the system (Settings, factory reset), root or the shell, and opens
the SD card page in Settings with an explanation instead. Hooked into StorageManagerService
(services.jar) by ../customize.sh; My Files is not modified, so its app updates keep the protection.
src/  : Java source
smali/: compiled form that the build copies into services.jar (new smali_classesN dir).
Rebuild: run the "SD storage page (Java -> smali)" workflow (.github/workflows/sdstorage.yml).
